<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia June palm oil output 788,000t - Ivan Wong.</title>
<headline>Malaysia June palm oil output 788,000t - Ivan Wong.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Malaysia's palm oil output in June was estimated at 788,000 tonnes against 790,640 tonnes in May, private crop forecaster Ivan Wong said on Monday.</p>
<p>He previously projected June's output at 785,000 tonnes.</p>
<p>Wong put palm oil stocks at the end of June at 795,000 tonnes, compared with the 711,841 tonnes calculated by the Palm Oil Registration and Licensing Authority in May.</p>
<p>Wong estimated exports in June unchanged at 595,000 tonnes from his last week forecast. Exports totalled 626,606 tonnes in May.</p>
</text>
